      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel like this could use a comment. What I *think* I figured out:\n\n`procs` is a temp buffer to copy the freeze_list to so that allocation of `batch` (both vector and elements) don\u0027t need to happen with the inner lock held.",
      "revId": "a0d9beadb09117305a75cd6503e4c34c02db9acc",
